   "giver": "brannoc",
   "requires": [
    "dust_of_shadows",
    "iron_for_hollis"
   ],
   "text": "It's time. Wood to catch, coal to hold the heat, dust to wake it. 20 logs, 10 coal and 6 shade dust, and we will see if the old fire remembers us.",
   "progress": "Wood, coal, dust. All three.",
   "done": "...There. Do you see it? A spark, deep in the stones. The Great Hearth is not dead. It is only sleeping. The Hollow Mines to the east hold what we need next. But that is a story for another day.",
